% multirow: a cell's text over several rows. \multirow is the engine's own,
% read by its tables: the text stands in the middle of the rows it spans, or
% level with the first for [t] and the last for [b]; the rows below it are
% left as the document wrote them, which is empty.
%
%   \multirow{2}{*}{Method} & 1 \\
%                           & 2 \\
